      "raw_text": "“'JUSTICE FOR ERIC SABER'\n\nJustice is the call of relatives &amp; supporters in the funeral march held to Manila North Cemetery for Eric Saber this Thursday, October 2.\nSaber was a construction worker who was killed on Sept. 21 during the police dispersal of a protest in Mendiola.”",
